        "Andresian p. 5"
      ],
      "comment": "Andresian’s and Traupman’s teapot. Morgan–Owens advises against it: the few passages show an earthenware vessel for storing wine or for baking, and say nothing of its shape (s.v. pitcher: teapot)."
